changeSet.comment:
Ticket: LF-0057. Generic outbox for reliable delayed work. Hangfire still owns execution state.
Index review: PK_OutboxMessages; UX_OutboxMessages_TenantId_IdempotencyKey so one communication has one publish intent;
IX_OutboxMessages_Status_CreatedAtUtc for the dispatcher. Performance note: the dispatcher reads pending rows by status, not by scanning jobs.
